# ==========================================
# common 模块 SPI 注册 (v5.4)
# EnvironmentPostProcessor: 注入 actuator/Prometheus 端点默认配置
# 注意：Spring Boot 3 仍通过 spring.factories 注册 EnvironmentPostProcessor
# ==========================================
org.springframework.boot.env.EnvironmentPostProcessor=\
com.redteam.common.telemetry.TelemetryEnvironmentPostProcessor
